{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113214602599-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113230411\"/><p>坪輋路一個貨倉失火，消防到場處理。</p><p>粉嶺發生火警。今晚(13日)8時18分，坪輋路近中電變壓站一個貨倉發生火警。消防接獲多個報案，一度派出兩條喉和兩隊煙帽隊灌救，並於晚上9時58分大致將火救熄。消防員之後繼續射水，協助火場降溫及散煙，暫時未知道火警成因。消防處呼籲，市民如受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請關閉門窗及保持鎮定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:36:23.810480+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:46:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:57:03.743760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:29:43.067108+00:00","content_hash":"a54fc6a80c3dfa376f72ed3c27e67680b4c1d84b1dbd0c2aa6b10147c4eb410a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:36:23.810480+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}